  "_comment": "AI 诊断基线样本集（T13）。Ported from tests/eval/baseline_samples.json (Python). Each sample is a typical Aliyun alert scenario; Judge evaluates AI output on the 5-dim scorecard (root cause accuracy, recommendation executability, evidence chain completeness, hallucination rate, response time). Modifications must keep baseline score >= 18/25 per tests in internal/eval/.",
